export anchor DenseListingStyle:
    number: 3
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dense listing
    idea: A compact work tool, with tables, mono figures and terse labels that fit the whole picture on one screen.
    base: light
    palette:
        background: #ffffff, tables and the page
        panel: #f3f5f7, the toolbar
        paneHead: #e8ecf0, the title bar of each pane
        menuBar: #20262d, the top menu bar, with #e9edf1 and #c7cfd7 text
        text: #11161b, body text and this week's chart bars
        muted: #4a5561, column headers, meta text and last week's bars
        line: #cfd5dc, grid lines between panes and under headers, with #e3e7eb between rows
        accent: #0b6b57, links, the primary button and the OK status
        risk: #875200, the RISK status
        late: #b3261e, the LATE status and the overdue count
        select: #fff4c2, the selected row and the focus fill
        focusRing: #e0a800, the 2px focus outline and the active tab marker is #f2c94c
    type:
        System sans for words, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto,
        sans-serif, at 13px body, 12px secondary text and 11px semibold
        capitals for headers. Figures, dates, codes and user handles use
        ui-monospace, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas, Liberation Mono, monospace,
        with tabular figures. Summary figures are 18px semibold mono.
    layout:
        A 36px dark menu bar with a mono wordmark, tabs, a quick search
        with a slash shortcut hint, and the user handle. A grey toolbar
        holds the title, the date, an update time, Export and New project.
        A strip of five summary cells runs edge to edge. Below it, the
        projects table fills the left pane, and a 360px right pane holds a
        compact bar chart and an activity log table. Below 1000px the panes
        stack. Below 640px the table drops the Team, Tasks and Owners
        columns and the summary strip becomes two columns.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 8px cell padding and 12px pane padding.
    density: High. 28px table rows, about 20 rows visible on a laptop.
    corners: 2px on buttons, fields and status badges. Everything else is square.
    borders: 1px grid lines everywhere, in #cfd5dc between panes and under headers and #e3e7eb between rows. Even rows get a #fafbfc band.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        12px square-cap line icons, only inside buttons. Status is an
        outlined mono badge with a shape glyph and a code word, a filled
        circle with OK, a triangle with RISK and a square with LATE. A key
        under the table spells out each code. Owners show as lowercase mono
        initials.
    focus: A 2px #e0a800 outline with the #fff4c2 fill. The primary button keeps its fill and takes the outline offset 1px.
    tone: Terse and technical, with abbreviations such as Due 7d, Hrs/wk and Done/wk, codes in capitals, and arrows for links.
